{
  "requirement": "HC represents a FIXME acknowledgment as a graph node and exposes its tracking\nissue relationships as labeled edges to GitHub issue nodes. A named FIXME also\nconnects the acknowledgment to the requirement whose gap it acknowledges;\nan unnamed FIXME connects directly to its tracking issues.\nEach issue named by the acknowledgment is available through its tracking edges.",
  "determination": {
    "FIXME": [
